 the hyperbola?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418046 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5ea54c52-c613-575d-9b4a-ae98c73f35ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418046 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the intersection of the paraboloid and the plane $z=1$, we substitute $z=1$ into the equation of the paraboloid, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12z & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 12(1) & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 12 & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $\\sqrt{3}$ and $2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418047 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "af8eee1b-35b6-51ee-8480-e799f2ebb8d2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418047 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284465 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418048 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418047 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418048 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b0e9f4df-c7d1-5c3e-9d66-792c898f4bac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418048 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186339088 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418049 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418051 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418049 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bbc73c40-2938-59e4-adf6-e2670e949f1e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418049 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186418046 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418050 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418048 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418050 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c8e375d5-a259-54e0-ae9f-f99977167c51" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418050 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186366233 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418051 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186418050 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418051 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "f747c054-c600-575d-8af5-3ac0554fc78c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418051 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323729 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
